{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-white-uk-plug-adapters-supplied-with-certain-electric-pumps-used-for-airtumble-gymnastic-tracks-2604-0213","content_id":"872d32ad-d801-47b9-9c07-58a809a98503","description":"Product Recall for White UK Plug Adapters presenting a serious risk of fire and electric shock.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"78d5bcb0-d428-4b9f-9377-e78d22deae6d","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-13T14:12:30+01:00","id":"78d5bcb0-d428-4b9f-9377-e78d22deae6d","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-13T14:12:30+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a0478beda82768016cb3edc/2604-0213-product-recall-air-pump-adapter.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: White UK Plug Adapters</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The affected adapters present a serious risk of electric shock and fire as they do not feature any safety shutters therefore allowing access to live parts. The adapter plug does not meet dimensional requirements and does not contain a fuse.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The products have been recalled from end users by AirTumble.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Adapters (Electrical)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Adapter models</td>\n      <td>WN-07 and No.7</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales period</td>\n      <td>April 2019 to April 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Two variants of white EU 2 pin to UK 3 pin plug adapters supplied with certain electric pumps used for AirTumble gymnastic tracks. Please note that the AirTumble gymnastic track itself is NOT affected. The recall only applies to the plug adapters.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_78d5bcb0-d428-4b9f-9377-e78d22deae6d\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a0478beda82768016cb3edc/2604-0213-product-recall-air-pump-adapter.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The affected adapters present a serious risk of electric shock and fire as they do not feature any safety shutters, therefore allowing access to live parts. The 3-pin plug does not meet the dimensional requirements of BS 1363 and may not make a secure connection with the mains socket as the plug pins are positioned too close to the edge of the adapter. This increases the risk of accidental contact during insertion or removal, and if the user were to touch a live part, they may receive an electric shock.</p>\n\n<p>Additionally, the adapters do not include any fuse which is required to ensure safe operation under fault conditions. In the event of an electrical surge or fault, the plug may overheat and ignite, causing a fire.</p>\n\n<p>The affected products do not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 or the Plugs and Sockets etc. (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The products have been recalled from end users by AirTumble.</p>\n\n<p>Owners of the electric pump that is fitted with an affected adapter should stop using it immediately and unplug from the mains power. Return the product to AirTumble who will fit a replacement converter/adapter to your air pump free of charge.</p>\n\n<p>To arrange your replacement, please contact AirTumble via email on <a href=\"mailto:sales@airtumble.co.uk\">sales@airtumble.co.uk</a>, or by calling 01428 748 615. For further information, please access the AirTumble recall notice here: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://airtumble.co.uk/urgent-product-safety-notice-recall/\">https://airtumble.co.uk/urgent-product-safety-notice-recall/</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0213</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-14T15:21:01Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-13","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-14T16:21:01+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-white-uk-plug-adapters-supplied-with-certain-electric-pumps-used-for-airtumble-gymnastic-tracks-2604-0213","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-white-uk-plug-adapters-supplied-with-certain-electric-pumps-used-for-airtumble-gymnastic-tracks-2604-0213","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-white-uk-plug-adapters-supplied-with-certain-electric-pumps-used-for-airtumble-gymnastic-tracks-2604-0213","content_id":"872d32ad-d801-47b9-9c07-58a809a98503","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-14T15:21:01Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: White UK Plug Adapters supplied with certain Electric Pumps used